  "readmeFile": "README.nuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.5.0: aligned with Caveman core 1.5.0 and targets .NET 10. New CavemanSemanticCachePlugin (semantic_cache_get/set/stats/clear) and CavemanConversationPlugin.compact_messages (tool calls and results never removed; JSON/XML/HTML/Markdown/code compressed, not stripped; optional Amazon Bedrock Converse output). Model names of Gemini, Qwen, DeepSeek, Grok, GLM, Spark, Mistral, Nova, Kimi, Ernie and Command are accepted. 1.4.4: aligned with Caveman core 1.4.4. CavemanServicesPlugin gains compress_sql (whitespace-safe SQL compression that preserves string literals, quoted identifiers, nested parentheses and comments; optional stripComments and VALUES folding with a CCR-hash reference for dropped tuples). CavemanRouterPlugin.detect_content_type now recognizes Sql content.",
